This page demonstrates '''treatment C''', an opt-in hero. A full-bleed lead image opens the page above the title, with its caption and credit below it, then the title and body follow. This is the Zeit and Tagesschau feature shape: image first, striking, reserved for a page whose lead image earns the whole opening.
